{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026NrtoyXh4lw1793058744.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國廉航捷藍航空第三季度虧損按年擴大八成，但公司行政總裁表明利潤率正在改善，公司股價在延長交易時段曾升逾一成。</p><p></p><p>捷藍航空第三季度蝕2.57億美元，經調整每股攤薄虧損60美仙，較預期多蝕5美仙。收入28.1億美元，則與預期相若。公司行政總裁傑拉蒂表示，強勁的需求令公司較預期能抵銷更多增加的燃料成本，而這股動力正延續至第四季度。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T00:40:37.950311+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T23:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T06:18:16.046553+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T00:38:17.520220+00:00","content_hash":"1b0f3079e5235bc5f1ece98dd633f3a9943ae6105b2b1c6ed48121c2b0571e72","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T00:40:37.950311+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}